<body>
  <h1>Authly SSO — Server (Backend) Integratsiya Qo'llanmasi</h1>
  <p><strong>Tashqi veb-sayt va axborot tizimlari backend dasturchilari uchun yagona kirish (SSO) integratsiyasi bo'yicha rasmiy texnik spetsifikatsiya.</strong></p>

  <table>
    <tr><th>Hujjat turi</th><td>Texnik spetsifikatsiya va amaliy qo'llanma</td></tr>
    <tr><th>Protokol</th><td>OAuth 2.0 (Authorization Code Grant Flow)</td></tr>
    <tr><th>Versiya</th><td>1.0.0 (Rasmiy nashr)</td></tr>
    <tr><th>Oxirgi yangilanish</th><td>2026-yil noyabr</td></tr>
    <tr><th>Authly API manzili</th><td>https://api.authly.uz</td></tr>
    <tr><th>Authly Web manzili</th><td>https://authly.uz</td></tr>
  </table>

  <h2>1. Umumiy Arxitektura va OAuth 2.0</h2>
  <p>Authly SSO xalqaro standart hisoblangan OAuth 2.0 (Authorization Code Grant) arxitekturasi asosida ishlaydi. Ilovangizning maxfiy kaliti (Client Secret) faqat serveringizda saqlanadi.</p>

  <h2>2. Muhit Parametrlari (Backend .env)</h2>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr><th>O'zgaruvchi Nomi</th><th>Namuna Qiymat</th><th>Majburiy</th><th>Vazifasi</th></tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td><code>AUTHLY_BACKEND_URL</code></td><td>https://api.authly.uz</td><td>Ha</td><td>Serverlararo so'rovlar manzili.</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>AUTHLY_FRONTEND_URL</code></td><td>https://authly.uz</td><td>Ha</td><td>Authly veb interfeysi manzili.</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>AUTHLY_CLIENT_ID</code></td><td>c4a7e91b82d3f...</td><td>Ha</td><td>Mijoz identifikatori.</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>AUTHLY_CLIENT_SECRET</code></td><td>s8xK29La0Qz7...</td><td>Ha</td><td>Maxfiy kalit (faqat serverda).</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>AUTHLY_REDIRECT_URI</code></td><td>https://saytingiz.uz/auth/callback</td><td>Ha</td><td>Callback manzili.</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>AUTHLY_WEBHOOK_SECRET</code></td><td>whsec_99a8b7c...</td><td>Ixtiyoriy</td><td>Webhook HMAC tekshirish kaliti.</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <h2>3. Token So'rovi (POST /oauth/token/)</h2>
  <pre><code>curl -X POST "https://api.authly.uz/oauth/token/" \
  -H "Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded" \
  -d "grant_type=authorization_code" \
  -d "client_id=SIZNING_CLIENT_ID" \
  -d "client_secret=SIZNING_CLIENT_SECRET" \
  -d "code=QABUL_QILINGAN_CODE" \
  -d "redirect_uri=https://saytingiz.uz/auth/callback"</code></pre>

  <h2>4. Profilni Yuklab Olish (GET /api/v1/sso/profile/)</h2>
  <pre><code>curl -X GET "https://api.authly.uz/api/v1/sso/profile/" \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer SIZNING_ACCESS_TOKEN" \
  -H "Accept: application/json"</code></pre>

  <h2>5. Webhook Imzosini Tekshirish (HMAC-SHA256)</h2>
  <pre><code>import hmac
import hashlib

def verify_authly_signature(raw_body: bytes, signature_header: str, secret: str) -> bool:
    if not signature_header or not signature_header.startswith("sha256="):
        return False
    expected_sig = signature_header.split("sha256=", 1)[1]
    calculated_sig = hmac.new(
        secret.encode("utf-8"),
        msg=raw_body,
        digestmod=hashlib.sha256
    ).hexdigest()
    return hmac.compare_digest(calculated_sig, expected_sig)</code></pre>

  <h2>6. Python / Django REST Framework Namunasi</h2>
  <pre><code># services/authly.py
import requests
from django.conf import settings
from django.contrib.auth import get_user_model
from rest_framework.exceptions import AuthenticationFailed

User = get_user_model()

class AuthlySSOService:
    @staticmethod
    def get_login_url(state: str = "") -> str:
        base_url = f"{settings.AUTHLY_FRONTEND_URL}/login"
        params = {
            "client_id": settings.AUTHLY_CLIENT_ID,
            "redirect_uri": settings.AUTHLY_REDIRECT_URI,
            "response_type": "code",
            "scope": "read",
        }
        if state:
            params["state"] = state
        req = requests.Request("GET", base_url, params=params).prepare()
        return req.url

    @staticmethod
    def exchange_code_for_token(code: str) -> dict:
        url = f"{settings.AUTHLY_BACKEND_URL}/oauth/token/"
        data = {
            "grant_type": "authorization_code",
            "client_id": settings.AUTHLY_CLIENT_ID,
            "client_secret": settings.AUTHLY_CLIENT_SECRET,
            "code": code,
            "redirect_uri": settings.AUTHLY_REDIRECT_URI,
        }
        resp = requests.post(url, data=data, timeout=10)
        if resp.status_code != 200:
            raise AuthenticationFailed("Authly token olishda xatolik yuz berdi.")
        return resp.json()

    @staticmethod
    def get_user_profile(access_token: str) -> dict:
        url = f"{settings.AUTHLY_BACKEND_URL}/api/v1/sso/profile/"
        headers = {"Authorization": f"Bearer {access_token}"}
        resp = requests.get(url, headers=headers, timeout=10)
        if resp.status_code != 200:
            raise AuthenticationFailed("Authly profil ma'lumotlarini olib bo'lmadi.")
        return resp.json()["data"]

    @classmethod
    def authenticate_or_register(cls, code: str):
        token_data = cls.exchange_code_for_token(code)
        profile = cls.get_user_profile(token_data["access_token"])
        user, _ = User.objects.update_or_create(
            authly_id=profile["authly_id"],
            defaults={
                "first_name": profile.get("first_name", ""),
                "last_name": profile.get("last_name", ""),
                "phone_number": profile.get("phone", ""),
                "avatar_url": profile.get("avatar") or "",
            }
        )
        return user</code></pre>
